        "accession_number": "0001831631-26-000028",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a leading provider of lending solutions that make the American dream of homeownership more accessible and achievable for all, especially the increasingly diverse communities of first-time homebuyers, through a broad suite of lending and real estate services that simplify one of life's most complex transactions.",
