        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our other intellectual property rights consist of unregistered copyrights, common law trademarks or servicemarks, trade secrets, proprietary know-how and technological innovations that we have developed to maintain our competitive position.",
